{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 4, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 16597789780346495802, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "hidden suite passed; test file untouched\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"ledger/__init__.py": {"bytes": 27, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "7ec6a9b0d10a936941a9134aff2540fcfb8dfda1bd57d58f46eab6bdb592fd2e"}, "ledger/currency.py": {"bytes": 586, "mtime": 1791867177.8829234, "sha256": "c6a28bd0c960aa6b910776c188060e536c555759141f4d23daa3b18378046693"}, "ledger/discounts.py": {"bytes": 154, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "ca6bc009ddec9b96e9dce613e450e2ca01e65f8ed5a309f383e21e354bb7ec36"}, "ledger/lines.py": {"bytes": 250, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "af67d4282c6d6a1644f025eceb4df16f828ad9d3a39faea5ed956ee655ff1683"}, "ledger/report.py": {"bytes": 252, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "9f260adb70c8bc21fd7f8a7386b8ff6782441f59c3e94e062da2a1aa15609b2e"}, "ledger/tax.py": {"bytes": 144, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "5101c17e6545aa9ad336a4f39ee1de235ce8aea6fbecdf69d7b720ac302ea97e"}, "ledger/totals.py": {"bytes": 292, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "d43041148eb2c535c8dccdb09cf8be5c430f21dab713e6011da0a34036ffa541"}, "tests/test_report.py": {"bytes": 144, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "9c00269575abb1361ebb609c04e6f8304bbb7034ade261d196e5174d16116e46"}, "tests/test_totals.py": {"bytes": 443, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "b33548e48cc53a932d7b6ef1355d7ed4c9b018e02cf492672becf8853777a1c3"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/a95d432f7bc115e3b642c41ee48344d81c6221c7/omp", "-p", "`tests/test_totals.py` is failing. Fix the bug.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-screen5-b2/omp-cap30-19-off/omp-19/transcripts/with/trig-omp-multistep/16/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 0, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-screen5-b2/omp-cap30-19-off/omp-19/cells/with/trig-omp-multistep/16/workspace", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/12.18.3 (/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/a95d432f7bc115e3b642c41ee48344d81c6221c7/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Root cause: `to_cents` does `int(amount * 100)`, which truncates float error (`19.99 * 100 == 1998.9999\u2026` \u2192 1998). Fix by converting through `Decimal` of the literal repr and rounding explicitly.\nI fixed the bug in `ledger/currency.py`. All 5 tests pass when I call them directly from Python, but I couldn't run them through pytest: it isn't installed, and the system Python blocks `pip install`.\n\n**Cause:** `to_cents` did `int(amount * 100)`. Floats can't store most decimal amounts exactly, so `19.99 * 100` comes out as `1998.9999\u2026`, and `int()` cuts that down to `1998`. Prices like `0.29` and `4.35` lost a cent the same way. Every total built on those values was then off by a cent or more, which broke all four tests in `tests/test_totals.py`.\n\n**Fix:** `to_cents` now turns the amount into a string first, converts that to `Decimal`, multiplies by 100 and rounds half-up to a whole cent:\n```python\nint((Decimal(str(amount)) * 100).quantize(Decimal(1), rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP))\n```\nBecause the conversion goes through the printed value (`19.99`), not the slightly-off float, it gives exact cents (`19.99` \u2192 `1999`).\n\n**Behaviour change:** amounts with more than two decimal places used to be cut down and are now rounded half-up, away from zero (`1.005` \u2192 `101`, `0.125` \u2192 `13`). Integers and negative numbers convert correctly (`10` \u2192 `1000`, `-0.29` \u2192 `-29`).\n\n**Checks:** all four tests in `tests/test_totals.py` and `test_format` in `tests/test_report.py` passed, plus the spot conversions above. To confirm under pytest, install it in a virtual environment and run `pytest -q`; I expect 5 passed.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 0, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 61997, "requests_cache_write": 16200, "requests_cost_usd": 0.1303474, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1845, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial16", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 31, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T04:52:33.981415+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 31.921, "t_checker_s": 0.381, "t_env_setup_s": 0.002, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1857, "tokens_cache_read": 61997, "tokens_cache_write": 16200, "tokens_fresh": 1857, "tokens_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_cache_read": 61997, "tokens_main_cache_write": 16200, "tokens_main_calls": 5, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_output": 1845, "tokens_output": 1845, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 61997, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 16200, "tokens_proxy_calls": 5, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_proxy_output": 1845, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 16, "ts